{"seq":1,"slug":"multimodal-data-mixture-curation","title":"图文/视频对的配比、去重与数据策展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/pretraining-alignment/multimodal-data-mixture-curation","wordCount":2768,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"图文-视频对的配比-去重与数据策展\">图文/视频对的配比、去重与数据策展</h1><p>2021 年 CLIP 用四亿对网络图文把零样本图像分类推到与有监督基线可比的水平（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00020\">CLIP</a>），一年后 LAION 把同类数据开源到 58.5 亿对（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.08402\">LAION-5B</a>）。两者共同确立了多模态预训练的一条硬规律：当架构趋同之后，能力差距主要由配对数据的规模与纯度决定。多模态的「数据策展」因此不是文本清洗的翻版——图片不能被解码成 token 逐个比对，视频还要处理时间轴与自动字幕的噪声。本页拆解三件事：配比（哪些模态、哪些来源、各占多少）、去重（跨模态的重复如何定义与消除）、策展（过滤、分级、合规的流水线）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图文对（image-text pair）指一张图与其描述文本构成的监督信号。多模态对比学习把成对样本拉进同一嵌入空间，其目标函数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\log\\frac{\\exp(\\text{sim}(v_i,t_i)/\\tau)}{\\sum_{j=1}^{N}\\exp(\\text{sim}(v_i,t_j)/\\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1354em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.307em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 对的视觉与文本嵌入，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度。该目标对数据分布极度敏感：一条错配的配对在分母里充当被误标的正样本，直接拉低可达性能。策展的全部工作，就是在喂进这个损失之前，把「看起来是正样本其实不是」的配对剔出去。</p>\n<p>与纯文本语料相比，配对语料有三处结构性差异，决定了手段不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>纯文本语料</th>\n<th>图文/视频配对语料</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小单元</td>\n<td>一个 token 串</td>\n<td>一对（图/视频，文本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复形态</td>\n<td>文档级、段落级近似</td>\n<td>图片感知哈希重复 + 多字幕同图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声来源</td>\n<td>模板、乱码、机器翻译</td>\n<td>alt-text 缺失、ASR 错误、图文错配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位成本</td>\n<td>低，可近乎无限抓取</td>\n<td>高，图/视频带宽、解码、版权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除粒度</td>\n<td>删文档</td>\n<td>删图/帧可能连带破坏其他配对记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;爬取 / 授权采集&lt;br/&gt;Common Crawl, WIT, 视频站&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;配对提取&lt;br/&gt;alt-text / ASR / OCR&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;基础过滤&lt;br/&gt;分辨率 / 时长 / NSFW / 语言&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;相似度过滤&lt;br/&gt;CLIP / SigLIP 打分阈值&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;去重&lt;br/&gt;pHash + 嵌入近邻&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;质量分级&lt;br/&gt;分档保留&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;配比混合&lt;br/&gt;模态 / 域 / 分辨率采样&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;训练消费&lt;br/&gt;对比 + 生成目标&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"爬取 / 授权采集&lt;br/&gt;Common Crawl, WIT, 视频站\"] --&gt; B[\"配对提取&lt;br/&gt;alt-text / ASR / OCR\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"基础过滤&lt;br/&gt;分辨率 / 时长 / NSFW / 语言\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"相似度过滤&lt;br/&gt;CLIP / SigLIP 打分阈值\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"去重&lt;br/&gt;pHash + 嵌入近邻\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"质量分级&lt;br/&gt;分档保留\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"配比混合&lt;br/&gt;模态 / 域 / 分辨率采样\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"训练消费&lt;br/&gt;对比 + 生成目标\"]</pre><p>整条链有损且昂贵：每一级过滤都同时砍掉噪声与稀有信号，阈值必须在具体训练预算下用消融确定，而非照搬他人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原始来源与获取管线\">原始来源与获取管线</h2><p>可公开获取的配对数据主要有三条来路。其一为网页图文：Common Crawl 存档里的 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 标签与其 HTML <code>alt</code> 属性天然构成弱配对，Conceptual Captions 从中抽出三百万对（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.25389\">CC3M</a>），Google 的 Wikipedia Image-Text 用维基条目的图与上下文得到一千一百万对（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.15278\">WIT</a>），LAION 把规模推到 58.5 亿对、其中 23.2 亿为英文（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.08402\">LAION-5B</a>）。其二为视频：HowTo100M 用教学视频的 ASR 生成一亿三千六百万个片段-文本对（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1906.03327\">HowTo100M</a>），WebVid-10M 提供一千万条带人工字幕的短视频（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.00650\">WebVid</a>），HD-VILA 把高分辨率长视频切到一亿量级（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.10337\">HD-VILA</a>）。其三为授权与自建：平台内部数据、图库采购、以及用强模型反向生成的高密度字幕。</p>\n<p>规模差异直接决定训练上限。DataComp 把不同筛选方法放在同一个 12.8 亿对池子上做受控比较，发现仅靠更好的过滤与去重，同一 CLIP 架构的零样本精度就能差出十个百分点以上——数据配方而非模型决定了多数收益（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.14108\">DataComp</a>）。这也是 2023 年之后多模态工作大多要交代「用了多少对、怎么筛的」，而不只报架构的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相似度过滤与质量分级\">相似度过滤与质量分级</h2><p>主流做法是用一个现成的图文模型（CLIP、SigLIP）给每一对算余弦相似度，低于阈值即丢弃（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.15343\">SigLIP</a>）。LAION 的英文子集即以 CLIP ViT-B/32 打分，常用阈值落在 0.24 至 0.28 区间，具体取值随目标分布浮动。这一操作便宜、可并行，是整条管线里性价比最高的一级。</p>\n<p>但它带着一个被反复点破的自指问题：<strong>用 CLIP 筛出来的数据去训练 CLIP</strong>，会把上一代模型的偏好固化成数据分布——它偏爱的构图、语言风格乃至语种会被系统性放大。MetaCLIP 改用更严格的元数据（标题、来源、语言）做均衡分布，绕开纯打分带来的选择偏差，证明「平衡」与「规模」可以同时改善（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.16671\">MetaCLIP</a>）。</p>\n<p>过滤强度同样非单调。与文本侧结论一致：小训练预算下阈值可以调高、只吃精华；预算放大后必须为尾部分布留住席位，否则稀有概念与长尾语言会消失，模型在这些切片上退化。操作上把过滤分档（例如 0.24 / 0.28 / 0.32 三档保留），再在配比阶段按预算分配各档比重，比单点硬阈值更稳。除相似度外，分辨率、宽高比、NSFW 内容、文字占比、语言识别都是常设的一级过滤器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去重-跨模态的重复如何定义\">去重：跨模态的重复如何定义</h2><p>文本去重的对象是近似文档；多模态去重的对象分裂成两层。图像层用感知哈希（pHash）或学习到的嵌入近邻找视觉重复——同一张图被不同网页以不同尺寸、水印、裁剪转载的情况极其普遍。文本层则要面对<strong>多字幕同图</strong>：一张图配十几条不同 alt-text，每条占用一个「独立」配对名额，去重后可能只剩一对或少数几对。</p>\n<p>语义去重把这一层推向更深。SemDeDup 用嵌入聚类删除语义近似而非字面近似的样本，在图文与文本场景都能在几乎不损失下游指标的前提下砍掉相当比例的数据（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.09540\">SemDeDup</a>）。文本侧的同名结论更早：去重能让模型记住更少的训练样本，并提升有效可训练步数（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.06499\">Deduplicating Training Data</a>）。</p>\n<p>去重的收益不只在效率。若训练池里存在大量重复的同一张受版权保护图片，模型更容易逐像素地复现它——重复是记忆化（memorization）与版权风险的放大器。因此在多模态里，去重同时是性能工序与合规工序：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>dup</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{dup}} = \\frac{|C| - |U|}{|C|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>式中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|C|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 为去重前配对总数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|U|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 为去重后唯一（图或语义簇）总数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>dup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{dup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即被剔除的重复占比。公开网页池的这一比例常在两位数百分比，视频侧因帧级重复更高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视频对的特殊性与配比\">视频对的特殊性与配比</h2><p>视频把每一对的信息量放大一到三个数量级，也把噪声同步放大。三个独有难点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间对齐</strong>：ASR 字幕与画面不同步，一段解说可能覆盖数十秒内容，配对粒度从「帧」退化为「片段」。</li>\n<li><strong>采样爆炸</strong>：一段五分钟视频若按 1 fps 拆帧就是三百个视觉单元，token 预算按帧数而非片段数增长，帧采样策略（均匀、关键帧、运动感知）成为独立设计维度。</li>\n<li><strong>文本质量塌陷</strong>：ASR 缺乏标点与实体规范，直接用作监督会把噪声写进跨模态对齐。可行做法是先用强多模态模型为片段重写描述（recaption），代价是引入新一轮模型偏好。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>配比（mixture）因此不是单一数字，而是一组采样概率。实践中需同时平衡：模态（图像 vs 视频 vs 纯文本）、来源（网页 vs 授权 vs 合成）、质量分档、语言与地域分布、分辨率与时长分桶。多个开源配方共同的教训是——把「图像/文本比例」当成单一超参数的逻辑站不住脚；有意义的是每个子分布以什么频率被采样，以及它在损失里贡献的梯度是否被过大或过小的桶主导。</p>\n<p>合成字幕是近年配比里增长最快的来源。DALL-E 3 用重写字幕训练把生成模型的文本对齐提到明显更好（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.11495\">DALL-E 3</a>）；ShareGPT4V 用强模型产出约一百二十万条高密度描述，补天然 alt-text 的信息不足（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.12793\">ShareGPT4V</a>）；CapsFusion 把原始字幕与合成字幕融合，兼顾事实性与丰富度（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.12033\">CapsFusion</a>）。合成数据的风险是分布窄化与自我循环，配比上通常作为「增强档」而非主粮。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>规模量级</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网页图文（alt-text）</td>\n<td>十亿~百亿对</td>\n<td>便宜、覆盖广</td>\n<td>图文弱相关、语种偏英语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频 ASR 字幕</td>\n<td>千万~亿级片段</td>\n<td>时序信号、动作丰富</td>\n<td>对齐差、文本噪声高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权 / 自建图库</td>\n<td>百万~千万</td>\n<td>质量与版权可控</td>\n<td>成本高、覆盖窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强模型重写字幕</td>\n<td>百万~千万</td>\n<td>文本密度高</td>\n<td>分布窄化、模型偏好固化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"策展的合规与治理\">策展的合规与治理</h2><p>数据策展的最后一公里是「能不能用、用了要交代什么」。2023 年底斯坦福互联网观察站报告指出 LAION-5B 中可检出儿童性虐待材料，LAION 随即下线相关数据集并启动清理（<a href=\"https://stacks.stanford.edu/file/druid:kh752sm9123/sio-laion-report.pdf\">SIO 报告</a>）——这成为公开图文数据集「事后审计」的转折点，也说明上线时的 NSFW 过滤器远不足以承担责任。</p>\n<p>监管侧，欧盟《人工智能法案》自 2024 年 8 月生效，其中通用人工智能模型的透明度义务自 2025 年 8 月起适用，要求提供训练内容摘要（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/oj\">EU AI Act</a>）。这意味着「训练数据来源」从工程细节变成合规披露项。策展流程因此需要保留可追溯的元数据：来源域名、抓取时间、许可状态、过滤与去重版本，以便在被问询或需要撤回时定位到具体批次。撤回（takedown）在多模态里尤其昂贵——删除一张图可能同时破坏多条配对记录及其在已发布数据集里的分片，故存储应让图与文分离、以索引关联，使撤图不波及无关文本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多模态预训练的能力差距主要由配对数据的规模与纯度决定；CLIP 过滤便宜有效但会自指放大偏好，需要 MetaCLIP 式的分布均衡来矫正。</li>\n<li>去重在图像层、文本层、语义层三处同时进行，既是提效工序，也是记忆化与版权风险的控制手段。</li>\n<li>过滤强度与训练预算相关而非单调；把过滤分档、在配比阶段按预算分配，比单点硬阈值更稳。</li>\n<li>视频把噪声与 token 成本同时放大，帧采样与重写字幕是独立的设计维度。</li>\n<li>配比是一组子分布采样概率，合成字幕是增长最快的增强档，合规披露已随 EU AI Act 成为硬要求。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本页属于「多模态预训练与对齐」章节的第一篇，章节的定位与学习路径见 <a href=\"./\">_INTRODUCTION</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图文/视频对的配比、去重与数据策展","id":"图文-视频对的配比-去重与数据策展"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"原始来源与获取管线","id":"原始来源与获取管线"},{"level":2,"text":"相似度过滤与质量分级","id":"相似度过滤与质量分级"},{"level":2,"text":"去重：跨模态的重复如何定义","id":"去重-跨模态的重复如何定义"},{"level":2,"text":"视频对的特殊性与配比","id":"视频对的特殊性与配比"},{"level":2,"text":"策展的合规与治理","id":"策展的合规与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"统一原生多模态 vs 模块化拼接架构选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/multimodal-architecture-representation/unified-vs-modular-architectures"},"next":{"title":"对比学习与生成式目标的训练机制权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/pretraining-alignment/contrastive-generative-objectives"}}